        "TileImage": "$($repository b542b0fe-36d2-4cde-88ff-345acf95909c).Image",
        "Description": "Shepherd: Your gamble with the nuke was a success Captain. I have a blank cheque and we will spend every cent of it on killing Hannan. Marrakesh, one of the last safe havens on earth left for Hannan and his men. 47, you are to go in there and kill him if he is there, or if he&apos;s not, then kill his most loyal colonels. Captain Price will visit a boneyard in Afghanistan, where Hannan is also rumoured to be. Make sure you bring back all the intel on Hannan&apos;s operations stored in an armoured van.",
